    ('Matched feedback and uncertainty','<label>Chart cohort <select id="cohort"><option value="A_all_attempted">All attempted · n160</option><option value="auto_flagged_descriptive">Automated risk flagged · n102</option><option value="auto_unflagged_descriptive">No automated risk flag · n58</option></select></label><p id="cohortnote"></p><div id="chart"></div><div id="effects"></div><p>10,000 image-paired bootstrap samples. Repeated seeds do not increase independent sample size. New exploratory two-contrast Holm families are separate from the parent four planned comparisons.</p>'),
    ('Semantic-preservation audit',f'<p><b>0/160 independently reviewed</b>. Human valid/invalid/ambiguous rates and valid-only accuracy effect are unknown. Human reviewer agreement is unavailable.</p><p><a href="{links}/semantic_review/index.html">Open blinded review interface</a> · <a href="{links}/semantic_review/INSTRUCTIONS.md">Instructions</a> · <a href="{links}/semantic_review/reviewer_1_template.csv">Reviewer 1 CSV</a> · <a href="{links}/semantic_review/reviewer_2_template.csv">Reviewer 2 CSV</a> · <a href="{links}/semantic_review/adjudication_template.csv">Adjudication CSV</a></p><p>40 complete blinded contact sheets are retained. Similarity, risk flags and target answers cannot certify preserved semantics. No human review was invented.</p>'),
    ('Reward diagnostics',f'<p>113/160 all-five ties (70.625%);47/160 nondegenerate (29.375%). Mean within-source sample variance .04513125. C4 saturates at1 for58.75%, at0 for28.75%. Selected36 candidate cases repeat exactly across three inference seeds.</p>{image("reward_variance")}{image("matched_effects")}<p>Computable: PASS. Tested reproducibility: PASS. Aggregate reference-score discrimination: PASS. Semantic interpretability: NOT VALIDATED. Suitability for editor learning: NOT VALIDATED.</p>'),
    ('Clean target training baseline',f'<p>Original-data-only train32/evaluation32, source/content disjoint. Historical development evaluation; not an untouched scientific test. Rank8 language q/v LoRA:112 tensors /1,605,632 trainable parameters. Frozen base and vision parameters remain invariant.</p><p>Two-step pilot PASS after preserved repairs;16-step main PASS plus one strict next-step replay. Fresh pinned-base adapter and optimizer reload PASS. Clean accuracy94.6875% before and after; no improvement claim.</p>{image("clean_accuracy") if summary else ""}{image("clean_training_diagnostics") if summary else ""}<p>Only one training seed and fixed-example continuation are tested. Full-model target tuning and historical pretrained-generator BF16 continuation remain NOT VALIDATED.</p>'),
    ('RL infrastructure','<p>Production categorical REINFORCE / diffusion DDPO score function. Production GRPO is absent. The finite group-relative reference is isolated. All27 production files match the prior audit and every reward-release guard still rejects training. Prior mathematical results are reused; no large Monte Carlo rerun.</p>'),
